     "reason": "Reproduced success probability is far from 0.2, indicating a misconfigured baseline.",
     "judge_reason": "The headline native baseline probability is 0.4946524, outside the required approximately 0.14–0.26 interval. Its shorter evolution and changed common initialization are disclosed, but do not satisfy this numerical matching condition. The separate archival reproduction reaches 0.2157546 at a different configuration.",
